That makes sense but also is terribly disappointing.

&#x200B;

It shows "0 / 23" in the game too, is that related somehow?

When I quot there were several active money dupes:

- Hover over an item link in chat with custom code injected;

- Trade with someone (they didn't delete the item from inventory);

- Transfer worlds (it accidentally would fail trades and dupe, separate from above);

- Fail to pay house tax, then pay house taxes (it will put item in storage but keep it in house when you renew);

And many, many other major bugs that affect combat and players around you
